---

<section
  id='experience'
  class='experience'>
  <div class='experience-inner'>
    <div class='section-heading'>
      <p class='section-number'>04</p>
      <h2>Experience</h2>
    </div>

    <div class='timeline'>
      <article class='timeline-item'>
        <div class='timeline-marker'></div>

        <div class='timeline-content'>
          <p class='timeline-period'>CURRENT</p>
          <h3>Web Developer · Designer · Technologist</h3>

          <p>
            Designing and building modern digital experiences across web
            development, technology, creative projects and user experience.
          </p>

          <div class='experience-tags'>
            <span>Web Development</span>
            <span>Design</span>
            <span>Technology</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class='timeline-item'>
        <div class='timeline-marker'></div>

        <div class='timeline-content'>
          <p class='timeline-period'>PREVIOUS EXPERIENCE</p>
          <h3>Technology & Digital Projects</h3>

          <p>
            Working across a range of digital projects involving websites,
            software, automation and emerging technologies.
          </p>

          <div class='experience-tags'>
            <span>JavaScript</span>
            <span>WordPress</span>
            <span>Automation</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class='timeline-item'>
        <div class='timeline-marker'></div>

        <div class='timeline-content'>
          <p class='timeline-period'>ONGOING</p>
          <h3>Mentoring & Knowledge Sharing</h3>

          <p>
            Helping others develop their technical skills and confidence through
            practical, hands-on learning.
          </p>

          <div class='experience-tags'>
            <span>Mentoring</span>
            <span>IT Training</span>
            <span>Problem Solving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .experience {
    padding: 140px var(--page-padding);
  }

  .experience-inner {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .section-number {
    color: var(--color-cyan);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-left: 40px;
    padding-left: 50px;
    border-left: 1px solid rgb(91 206 250 / 18%);
  }

  .timeline-item {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 70px;
  }

  .timeline-item:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .timeline-marker {
    position: absolute;

    left: -56px;
    top: 5px;

    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;

    border: 2px solid var(--color-cyan);
    border-radius: 50%;

    background: var(--color-background);

    box-shadow:
      0 0 10px rgb(91 206 250 / 50%),
      0 0 25px rgb(91 206 250 / 20%);
  }

  .timeline-period {
    margin: 0 0 12px;

    color: var(--color-cyan);

    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .timeline-content h3 {
    margin: 0 0 15px;

    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .timeline-content > p:not(.timeline-period) {
    max-width: 700px;

    margin: 0 0 22px;

    color: #9ba7b5;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .experience-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .experience-tags span {
    padding: 6px 10px;

    border: 1px solid rgb(91 206 250 / 15%);
    border-radius: 3px;

    color: #9ba7b5;

    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .experience {
      padding: 100px var(--page-padding);
    }

    .timeline {
      margin-left: 10px;
      padding-left: 35px;
    }

    .timeline-marker {
      left: -41px;
    }
  }
</style>
